  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.sapa.2": "Greetings, %1$s. May today treat you well.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.sapa.3": "Ah, a visitor. Please, %1$s.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.sapa.4": "A quiet day, isn't it, %1$s?",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.sapa.5": "%1$s! We haven't spoken in a while.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.basa_basi.0": "Well, life goes on.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.basa_basi.1": "Days here are much the same, %1$s.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.basa_basi.2": "A full belly and a roof that holds: that's enough.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.basa_basi.3": "People say %2$s is the talk of the day.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.basa_basi.4": "Have you eaten, %1$s? Don't forget to eat.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.basa_basi.5": "The wind is pleasantly cool today.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.beri_kabar.0": "I heard some news about %2$s.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.beri_kabar.1": "Have you heard about %2$s, %1$s?",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.beri_kabar.2": "There's a story about %2$s. Everyone's talking about it.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.beri_kabar.3": "About %2$s, I know a little.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.tanya.0": "What do you make of %2$s, %1$s?",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.tanya.1": "Where are you from, %1$s? I rarely see your face.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.tanya.2": "May I ask you something, %1$s?",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.tanya.3": "Do you know anything about %2$s?",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.reaksi.0": "Oh, I see.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.reaksi.1": "Really? I never would have guessed.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.reaksi.2": "Hmm... that makes sense.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.reaksi.3": "Oh dear, how sad.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.reaksi.4": "Ha! Good to hear.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.reaksi.5": "I don't know, %1$s. I don't know what to say.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.terima_kasih.0": "Thank you, %1$s.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.terima_kasih.1": "You are very kind, %1$s.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.terima_kasih.2": "I won't forget your kindness.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.terima_kasih.3": "Oh, you embarrass me. Thank you.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.tolak.0": "Sorry, %1$s, I can't.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.tolak.1": "That's none of my business.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.tolak.2": "Better not, %1$s.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.tolak.3": "Not now. Some other time.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.tutup.0": "Until next time, %1$s.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.tutup.1": "Take care on the road, %1$s.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.tutup.2": "Forgive me, my work is waiting.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.tutup.3": "That's all for now. Do drop by again.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.tutup.4": "May the heavens watch over you.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.tutup.5": "I have to go. We'll pick this up another time.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.potong.0": "Wait! What's going on over there?",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.potong.1": "Sorry, %1$s, one moment...",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.potong.2": "Heavens, did you hear that?",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.potong.3": "Quick, quick, get inside!",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.kembali.0": "Where were we? Ah yes, %2$s.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.kembali.1": "Sorry for the interruption. So, as I was saying...",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.kembali.2": "Now, back to %2$s.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.kilas_balik.0": "Remember your promise, %1$s?",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.kilas_balik.1": "Haven't seen you in a long time, %1$s.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.kilas_balik.2": "A lot has happened since we last met.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.kilas_balik.3": "I still remember what you did back then.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.sambung_rasa.0": "Hmm.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.sambung_rasa.1": "Oh yes?",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.sambung_rasa.2": "And then?",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.sambung_rasa.3": "Yes, yes.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.sambung_rasa.4": "No way?",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.sambung_rasa.5": "Wow.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.koreksi.0": "That's not how it was. I saw it myself.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.koreksi.1": "Don't exaggerate. The truth wasn't that dramatic.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.koreksi.2": "You heard wrong. The story is different.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.umpan_gosip.0": "Psst, have you heard?",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.umpan_gosip.1": "Want to hear the latest?",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.umpan_gosip.2": "Don't tell anyone, all right...",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.umpan_gosip.3": "I bet you haven't heard about %2$s.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.puji.0": "You look very well today.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.puji.1": "Your work is always neat; I admire it.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.puji.2": "People like you are rare.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.hina.0": "Tch. Someone like you knows no shame.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.hina.1": "Watch your mouth.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.hina.2": "Go away before I lose my patience.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.minta.0": "Could you help me, %1$s?",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.minta.1": "I need a small favour.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.minta.2": "If it's no trouble, %1$s...",
