  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.janji.1": "Very well, I'll hold you to your word.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.janji.2": "I'll be waiting; don't forget.",
  "kultivator.kota42.cakap.cadangan.pamit.0": "I'll take my leave.",
